<title>USA: Dlr/mark above 1.79 at US noon despite Tietmeyer.</title>
<headline>Dlr/mark above 1.79 at US noon despite Tietmeyer.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Dlr/mark briefly dips to 1.7870, but 1.7850 support holds, after Tietmeyer hopes forex rate correction does not go too far, also watching forex market developments very closely.</p>
<p>*Dealers call Tietmeyer's comments relatively moderate.</p>
<p>*Sterling/mark climbs back above 3.00, helps dollar/mark.</p>
<p>*Cable also firm, helped by UK finmin Brown comments.</p>
</text>
